  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A black ink line drawing of a valley of domed huts, rabbit eared creatures, a city of towers and crystal mountains under clouds and a ringed planet.",
    "description": "A landscape format pen and ink drawing on white paper, made as the source for a screen print. In pure black line with no fill: a ringed planet at upper left, outlined cumulus clouds and a looping rainbow arc across the top, faceted crystal mountains at left, a cluster of apartment towers with window grids at right, and tall rabbit eared creatures standing among tent shapes at centre left. The lower half is a terrain of concentric contour lines around domed huts with arched doors, standing stones, and small eyed creatures, like islands in a rippling lake.",
    "impression": "The volcano ball lake world before colour: the same huts, city block, crystal mountains and ringed planet drawn as a single confident line. The contour ripples around the huts make the ground read as water or sound waves. It shows how much of these worlds is in the line alone.",
